WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:06.000
A question becomes a session.
Illustration only, not a real research result.

00:06.000 --> 00:12.000
The planner requests a task graph through OpenRouter.
PlanReady makes that structure observable.

00:12.000 --> 00:20.000
Research queries arXiv and GitHub.
The model extracts facts, entities and gaps.

00:20.000 --> 00:26.000
Verification reports model judgments, not calibrated truth.
Skill builder packages knowledge; humans control active loops.

00:26.000 --> 00:32.000
React, FastAPI, the event bus and MongoDB support the runtime.
The command-center pipeline is a separate scripted demo.
